Rationale: The claim has two material parts: (1) the dam was inaugurated by Felipe de Jesús Calderón Hinojosa, and (2) the waterway is one of the biggest in Nayarit, Mexico along with The Mololoa River. The evidence supports that Felipe Calderón Hinojosa was the President of Mexico from 2006-2012. However, no evidence identifies the specific waterway whose dam was completed on July 30, 2012, nor does any evidence confirm that Calderón inaugurated it or that it is one of the biggest in Nayarit. The dam completion date and inauguration are not linked to any specific waterway in the provided evidence. Therefore, further investigation is needed to confirm these details.
